!**/src/test/**/build/

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# Only the settings that every contributor should share are tracked. The rest of .idea
# is per-user or machine-specific and stays ignored: workspace.xml and shelf/, the local
# JDK name in misc.xml, the Gradle and compiler configuration IDEA regenerates on import,
# and plugin bookkeeping such as copilot.data.migration.*.xml.
#
# .editorconfig stays the source of truth for formatting. The shared code style in
# .idea/codeStyles mirrors it for the IDEA formatter, so "Reformat Code" and
# "./gradlew ktlintCheck" agree.
.idea/*
!.idea/.gitignore
!.idea/codeStyles/
!.idea/dictionaries/
!.idea/inspectionProfiles/
!.idea/icon.png
!.idea/kotlinc.xml
!.idea/ktlint-plugin.xml
!.idea/vcs.xml
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

### Kotlin ###
.kotlin

