### Local working files ###
# Not repository content, and not meant to travel: the images are what gets uploaded, so the script
# that renders them is only a copy that can disagree with them; the skill is what the agent reads from
# this machine; the forum pages are pasted into skUnity and MINEBBS rather than published from here.
# Remove a line to start tracking that file.
scripts/make-icons.py
.dsh/
docs/minebbs-*
docs/skunity-*
